{"articleNo":"668","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=668&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"신입생 도서관 이용안내(도서대출)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.03.03","hit":"15878","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">신입생 도서관 이용안내</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><img height=\"13\" src=\"file:///C:DOCUME~1%EB%8C%80%EC%B6%9C%EC%8B%A4LOCALS~1TempHncBinDataEMB00000d30059d.gif\" width=\"16\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">신입생 도서대출 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;- 학부 및 대학원 신입생인 경우 학생증 발급전이라도 본인 확인후 도서대출이 이 가능하니 많은 이용 바랍니다.(신분증 지참)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 제1자료실(도서관3층) 대출 데스크에서&nbsp;대출 할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><img height=\"13\" src=\"file:///C:DOCUME~1%EB%8C%80%EC%B6%9C%EC%8B%A4LOCALS~1TempHncBinDataEMB00000d30059d.gif\" width=\"16\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">실별 이용시간 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1